 Patriotism<br /> <br /> <b>Strength </b>\u2022\u2022, <b>Dexterity</b> \u2022\u2022\u2022, <b>Stamina </b>\u2022\u2022<br /> <b>Athletics</b> \u2022\u2022 (Jogging), <b>Drive</b> \u2022\u2022 (Off-Road), <b>Firearms </b>\u2022\u2022, <b>Stealth</b> \u2022<br /> <b>Merits:</b> Professional Training (Student) \u2022, Contacts (University Times) \u2022, Contacts (GCU History department) \u2022, Multilingual (English, Spanish), Deathsight \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022, Resources \u2022, Striking Looks \u2022, Barfly \u2022\u2022<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Then, the next day, he gains a dot in Drive, Firearms, and Survival. His player decides to keep the Jogging specialty.<br /> <br /> The final result is:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <b>Aspirations:</b><div style=\"margin-left:40px\">\u2022 Pay my way through college<br /> \u2022 Convince the Park to instate better safety procedures related to the bears.<br /> \u2022 Get these dead people to stop <i>bothering</i> me.</div> <br /> <b>Motivations:</b> Faith, Knowledge, Patriotism<br /> <br /> <b>Strength </b>\u2022\u2022, <b>Dexterity</b> \u2022\u2022\u2022, <b>Stamina </b>\u2022\u2022<br /> <b>Athletics</b> \u2022\u2022 (Jogging), <b>Drive</b> \u2022\u2022 (Off-Road), <b>Firearms </b>\u2022\u2022, <b>Stealth</b> \u2022, <b>Survival </b>\u2022\u2022<br /> <b>Merits:</b> Professional Training (Student) \u2022, Contacts (University Times) \u2022, Contacts (GCU History department) \u2022, Multilingual (English, Spanish), Deathsight \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022, Resources \u2022, Striking Looks \u2022, Barfly \u2022\u2022<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> * Asset Skills: <i>Animal Ken</i> and <i>Survival</i><br /> <hr /><br /> I dunno, could be fun. It probably would be simpler to just let you cash in your Merit dots and pick up appropriate new merits, wouldn't it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-10T07:48:19-07:00","id":164828,"title":"","content":"Hmm, interesting, how about this option as a merit?<br /> <br /> Actually, that would be interesting ,a line of resurrection merits that change the way sin-eaters come back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[